          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The soul pact grants you one revival. You can't use your original role's skills, pick up, or use items; only empty-hand melee: within 3 blocks you attempt a kill every 2 seconds, still subject to shields and death-immunity. You always glow and emit soul particles; your victory follows the faction of the nearest non-attached living player at revival (including neutral/custom factions), and you won't revive again.",
